  "definition_ja": "2 つ以上の数や式を合わせて、その和を求める。",
  "definition_en": "To combine two or more numbers or expressions to find their sum.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "If x − 5 = 7, add 5 to both sides, and you get x = 12.",
      "ja": "x − 5 = 7 なら、両辺に 5 を足して x = 12。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Add 4x − 7 and −x + 3.",
      "ja": "4x − 7 と −x + 3 を足せ。",
      "register": "written"
    },
    {
      "en": "When you add 2/3 and 1/6, you need a common denominator first.",
      "ja": "2/3 と 1/6 を足すときは、まず通分が必要だよ。",
      "register": "spoken"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [],
  "pitfalls": [
    "語順が日本語と逆。「A に B を足す」は add B to A（add 5 to x は x + 5）。",
    "add A and B は「A と B を足す」。その結果の和は sum（the sum of A and B）。",
    "名詞の「足し算・加法」は addition（エントリ addition）。式の + は plus と読む。"
